    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d135">

                <pb facs="0230" n="224" sameAs="frus:frus1901China/pg224"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Rockhill to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 110.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Commissioner of the United States to China</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Peking, China</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1901-06-08"><hi rendition="#italic">June 8,
                                1901</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to honor to transmit herewith for
                    your information a list of the indemnities asked until the 1st of July, 1901,
                    prepared by the committee on the payment of indemnities. The letter of Mr. von
                    Mumm accompanying it states that it is the opinion of said committee that the
                    total, which is provisionally given as haikwan taels 462,538,116.22, will not,
                    when adjusted, exceed 450,000,000 of taels.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. W. Rockhill</hi>.</signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d135-a1.xml" xpointer="d135-a1"/>
            </div>
